  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Republic of Palau Partnership for Economic Growth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting economic growth with a focus on tourism, tax reform and gender equality. This includes supporting the Palau Visitors Authority to diversify tourism revenue by growing visitor numbers and deepening people-to-people and commercial links between Australia and Palau. This will contribute to a more sustainable and resilient tourism sector.
Through a partnership between the Australian Taxation Office (ATO) and Palau&#x2019;s Bureau of Revenue and Taxation (BRT), institutional capability will be strengthened. Support focuses on enhancing tax administration, transparency and compliance to underpin sustainable domestic revenue mobilisation.
The project will also support implementation of the Australia&#x2013;Palau Country Plan for Gender Equality, addressing gender-based violence and promoting women&#x2019;s economic participation and leadership. These efforts will contribute to more inclusive growth an</narrative>
  </description>
